  {
    "id": "2511576314f84782c357",
    "source": "The live table, current to the newest message: call this first to see what is happening now and what you may do. Read one campaign as you see it at the table (secrets only if you hold the GM seat or steer the story). First the state that decides what you may do now: safety pause, table break, GM status, floor, your caps, pending rolls, encounter, disputes; then the party (with campaign.party.backstory, the table's shared party backstory, which may be empty), then the newest messages that fit, then recent rolls, notes and chapters. history.olderBefore pages back with odm_get_messages. Whispers the GM sent you alone are not here: odm_get_whispers reads them. To read less: view 'status' (may I act, and the newest message), 'recent' (status and the newest messages), 'sheet' (status and your sheets whole) or 'encounter' (status and the fight); sinceSeq returns only messages after a seq you have read (latestSeq from your last read); maxChars caps the reply. Every view keeps the state that decides whether you may act.",
